### =========================================

### AUTENTICACIÓN ADMINISTRADOR - ADMIN LOGIN

### =========================================

### 0. Login administrador y guardar token JWT automáticamente

POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "[admin@smartqr.com](mailto:admin@smartqr.com)",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

> {%
     client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.access_token);
     %}

### =========================================

### GENERACIÓN QR - ADMIN

### =========================================

### 1. Generar y guardar QR para la Mesa 5

POST http://localhost:8080/qr/table/5
Accept: image/png
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resultado esperado: HTTP 201 Created

### Archivo generado: requests/table_qr/table-5-qr.png

### =========================================

### PRUEBAS DE PRODUCTOS

### (ADMIN)

### =========================================

### 2. [ADMIN] Ver todos los productos

GET http://localhost:8080/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resultado esperado: HTTP 200 OK

### 3. [ADMIN] Crear un producto nuevo

POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Montadito Demo Admin",
  "description": "Producto creado por administrador para validar permisos",
  "price": 2.50,
  "category": "MONTADITO",
  "imageUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/montadito-demo-admin.png"
}

### Resultado esperado: HTTP 201 Created

### 4. [ADMIN] Ver productos sin stock

GET http://localhost:8080/products/out-of-stock
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resultado esperado: HTTP 200 OK

### =========================================

### OPERACIONES INTERNAS - ADMIN

### =========================================

### 5. [ADMIN] Ver todos los pedidos activos de la Mesa 5

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/table/5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resultado esperado: HTTP 200 OK

### 6. [ADMIN] Ver la cola de cocina

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/kitchen/queue
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resultado esperado: HTTP 200 OK
